From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sargun Vohra <sargunv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 04:16:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Carry plugin OpenGL attributes by name

A plugin program's OpenGL attribute list leaves out the attributes of
properties bound as uniforms, but the program indexed that list by each
active attribute's location, so a data-driven attribute after a
uniform-bound one received the wrong id. Active attributes now match
declared ones by name, so explicit locations are optional on OpenGL.
Includes the first rendering tests of data-driven plugin paint attributes
on OpenGL, Metal and Vulkan. Not yet proposed upstream.

Carried by maplibre-plugins until it lands upstream.
